//! Device operator traits: the `Op*API` definitions (e.g. `OpAddAPI`) that
//! devices implement to back the user-facing operators of
//! [`crate::tensor::operators`].
//!
//! Most traits are generated by `#[duplicate_item]` over dtype combinations;
//! extend the corresponding macro invocation to add a new operator rather
//! than writing a new trait by hand.

